ord and handed it over to [[DeFoe]], who had been demoted to a delivery boy. They did not join DeFoe in the attempt to kill [[Dante Vale]] with the sword. {{source|The Treasures of the Argonauts}}\n\n{{clear}}","text":"The Organization archaeologists were sent with DeFoe to Silene, Libya, to unearth the Sword of Saint George. They managed to uncover the sword and handed it over to DeFoe, who had been demoted to a delivery boy. They did not join DeFoe in the attempt to kill Dante Vale with the sword. [The Treasures of the Argonauts]"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nS1E10 Archaeoligists.png\nS1E10 Archaeologist with St George Sword.png|Uncovering the Sword of Saint George\nS1E10 DeFoe and the archaeologists.png\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Minor characters]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]","text":"Image caption: Uncovering the Sword of Saint George"}],"full_text":"The Organization archaeologists are a group of Suit within the Organization that assist in digging up ancient artifacts. They operate from Silene, Libya.\n\nHistory\n\nThe Organization archaeologists were sent with DeFoe to Silene, Libya, to unearth the Sword of Saint George. They managed to uncover the sword and handed it over to DeFoe, who had been demoted to a delivery boy. They did not join DeFoe in the attempt to kill Dante Vale with the sword. [The Treasures of the Argonauts]\n\nGallery\n\nImage caption: Uncovering the Sword of Saint George","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image     = File:S1E10 Archaeoligists.png\n| aliases   = \n| relations = \n| base      = [[Silene, Libya]]\n| group     = [[The Organization]] <br> [[Suits]]\n| first     = \"[[The Treasures of the Argonauts]]\"\n| last      = \n| gender    = Male\n| hair      = Brown\n| eyes      = Brown\n| va        = \n}}\nThe '''Organization archaeologists''' are a group of [[Suit]] within [[the Organization]] that assist in digging up ancient artifacts. They operate from [[Silene, Libya]].\n\n== History ==\nThe Organization archaeologists were sent with [[DeFoe]] to [[Silene, Libya]], to unearth the [[Sword of Saint George]]. They managed to uncover the sword and handed it over to [[DeFoe]], who had been demoted to a delivery boy. They did not join DeFoe in the attempt to kill [[Dante Vale]] with the sword. {{source|The Treasures of the Argonauts}}\n\n{{clear}}\n== Gallery ==\n{{gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nS1E10 Archaeoligists.png\nS1E10 Archaeologist with St George Sword.png|Uncovering the Sword of Saint George\nS1E10 DeFoe and the archaeologists.png\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Minor characters]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]","categories":["Characters","Minor characters","Organization members"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:17624","status":"resolved","target_title":"Silene, Libya","label":"Silene, Libya","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Silene%2C_Libya","href":"#/categories?name=Silene%2C%20Libya"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3366","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Treasures of the Argonauts","label":"The Treasures of the Argonauts","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Treasures_of_the_Argonauts","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3366"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com